OL,3,AThree Iran-backed suspects plotted
OL,4,Aattacks including RAF Fairford
OL,5,Aincident, US says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe three men have been accused by the
OL,8,FDOJ of being involved in 18 attacks and
OL,9,Fattempted attacks, including in London,
OL,10,FAmsterdam and Paris. Some of the
OL,11,Fincidents were said to be directed by
OL,12,Fthe men over FaceTime.
OL,14,FThe DOJ said they acted in the name of
OL,15,Fthe group Harakat Ashab al-Yamin
OL,16,Fal-Islamiya (HAYI).
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
