OL,3,ADemocrat Scott Colom seals historic win
OL,4,Ain Mississippi Senate race
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemocrat Scott Colom has won the US
OL,7,FSenate race in Mississippi, delivering
OL,8,Fa shock victory for the party in a
OL,9,Fdeeply conservative state that has
OL,10,Felected Republicans for decades.
OL,12,FColom's victory makes him the first
OL,13,Fblack person from Mississippi to be
OL,14,Felected to the US Senate in more than
OL,15,F140 years.
OL,17,FOnly a few thousand votes separated
OL,18,FColom from his Republican opponent, the
OL,19,Fincumbent Cindy Hyde-Smith.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
