OL,3,ADemocrat Scott Colom seals historic win
OL,4,Ain Mississippi Senate race
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe margin was so close that the race
OL,7,Fcould not be called until more than a
OL,8,Fweek after election day, as local
OL,9,Fofficials counted every single ballot
OL,10,Fthat had arrived before the deadline.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
