OL,3,ASchools in Italy, Scotland and Northern
OL,4,AIreland hit by threats in suspected
OL,5,Abomb hoax
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome 6,300 schools across Italy and
OL,8,Fmore than 700 in Scotland and Northern
OL,9,FIreland have received bomb threats,
OL,10,Faccording to local authorities.
OL,12,FIn Italy a number of buildings were
OL,13,Fevacuated as a precaution but Prime
OL,14,FMinister Giorgia Meloni said checks so
OL,15,Ffar had not indicated any evidence of
OL,16,F"concrete danger".
OL,18,F"These reports appear rather linked to
OL,19,Fa strategy intended to cause alarm and
OL,20,Fconcern," she said on Facebook.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
